{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2020-11-16 01:00:00', 'title': 'PNC ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO BUY BBVA USA BANCSHARES, INC.', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, NOV. 16, 2020 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) AND THE SPANISH FINANCIAL GROUP, BANCO BILBAO VIZCAYA ARGENTARIA, S.A. (NYSE AND MAD: BBVA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT FOR PNC TO ACQUIRE BBVA USA BANCSHARES, INC....'}